---
// A guide as the design's guide card: its drawing and a "Novinka 2027" tag, the name, one line (left out
// on the hub), the key numbers and, at the foot, how many rules and templates it holds. The whole card is
// the link.
import type { GuideCardView } from '../../lib/kit/links.ts';
import Tag from './Tag.astro';

interface Props {
  card: GuideCardView;
  heading: 'h2' | 'h3' | 'h4';
  // The card's own ground: `card` on the paper ground, `paper` on a card-coloured section.
  surface?: 'card' | 'paper';
  // The hub's cards leave the one line out.
  summary?: boolean;
}

const { card, heading: Heading, surface = 'card', summary = true } = Astro.props;
---

<a
  href={card.href}
  data-surface={surface}
  class="group flex h-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-card px-5 py-[18px] text-ink no-underline transition-[border-color,translate,box-shadow] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-ink hover:shadow-[0_10px_24px_-16px_var(--color-night)] data-[surface=paper]:bg-paper motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0"
>
  <span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
    <span class="flex size-[42px] items-center justify-center rounded-[13px] bg-forest text-cream">
      <svg
        aria-hidden="true"
        width="22"
        height="22"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.9"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
      >
        <path d={card.icon}></path>
      </svg>
    </span>
    {card.newTag && <Tag label={card.newTag} tone="new" />}
  </span>
  <Heading class="h-card mt-1 text-[21px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-balance">{card.title}</Heading>
  {summary && <span class="text-[15px] leading-[1.4] text-muted">{card.summary}</span>}
  {card.chips.length > 0 && (
    <span class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
      {card.chips.map((chip) => (
        <span class="inline-flex min-h-[26px] items-center rounded-lg bg-chip px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12.5px] leading-[1.3] font-semibold">
          {chip}
        </span>
      ))}
    </span>
  )}
  <span class="mt-auto flex items-center justify-between border-t border-line pt-2.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-muted">
    <span>{card.count}</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-[18px] text-ink transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-[3px]">
      →
    </span>
  </span>
</a>
